## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Spawn Pressure (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Glowing Wand, Genius Wand, Lightning Truncheon, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive
- Core: Glowing Wand, Genius Wand, Lightning Truncheon
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when your team lacks early magic penetration and the enemy mid cannot force repeated all-ins before level 4.; Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when assassins can reach Zhask before he fuses with Nightmaric Spawn.; Winter Crown over Holy Crystal when Use when one dive combo decides every objective fight and Flicker alone is not enough space.
- Total cost: 11980 gold

Default ranked setup built around repeated spawn hits: Glowing Wand applies anti-sustain, Genius Wand stacks shred, and Lightning Truncheon gives wave and pick burst once enemies stay inside the spawn zone.

### Ultimate Tempo (Mid)

- Items: Demon Boots, Glowing Wand, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Lightning Truncheon
- Core: Glowing Wand, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Demon Boots when Use when your lane support or blue buff access solves mana and you want faster spawn and ultimate cycles.; Blood Wings over Lightning Truncheon when Use when your lead is already secured and the only losing condition is dying before the second fused spawn.; Genius Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when your jungler or gold laner also deals meaningful magic damage and benefits from stacked Magic Defense reduction.
- Total cost: 12040 gold

Tempo build for skirmish-heavy games. Fleeting Time turns kills and assists into faster Dominator's Descent windows, while Demon Boots keeps repeated spawn placements from draining mana before objectives.

### Anti-Dive Scaling (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy threatens damage but not enough crowd control to justify Tough Boots and Purify together.; Holy Crystal over Winter Crown when Use when your front line reliably blocks dive and Zhask can spend the fourth slot on damage instead of stasis.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use against sustain-heavy front lines where anti-heal matters more than a late shield.
- Total cost: 10960 gold

Defensive scaling setup for drafts with hard engage. Tough Boots, Purify, Clock of Destiny, and Winter Crown buy the time Zhask needs to fuse, reset position, and keep fighting around the enhanced spawn.

